abstract: "Code, split definition, configurations, per-run metrics and predictions for a controlled comparison of seven classifiers (TF-IDF+LR, BiLSTM, DistilBERT, RoBERTa, HateBERT, toxic-bert, BERT-base) for three-class hate speech detection on the Davidson et al. corpus."
